quirk q-0ef521c0e0 n=1 src=agent "Mode switch rebuilds the UI: refs from before (e.g. digits) go stale, so observe again. The nav pane closes itself after choosing a mode. Display is read via the name 'Display is N' on CalculatorResults. Buttons work with invoke in background."
